{"effort": "high", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "recorded_at": "2026-10-29T04:20:27Z", "response": {"container": null, "content": [{"thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"caller": {"type": "direct"}, "id": "toolu_01UBfenAaMVwAMWwwVMLFSoz", "input": {"claims": [{"citations": ["E-004466"], "quotes": [{"event_id": "E-004466", "field": "logon.type", "text": "remote_interactive"}], "text": "it-ops2 opened a remote interactive (RDP-style) session on SRV-01 from 192.0.2.21 at 02:11 UTC, which is off-hours. This is the only event from that IP and the only it-ops2 activity in the 24-hour window."}, {"citations": ["E-004465"], "quotes": [{"event_id": "E-004465", "field": "process.command_line", "text": "net.exe localgroup Administrators svc-backup /add"}], "text": "Two minutes later, net.exe launched from mmc.exe under it-ops2 added svc-backup to the local Administrators group. This is a manual change to privileged group membership."}, {"citations": ["E-001984", "E-002016"], "quotes": [], "text": "I found no corroborating malicious indicators and no evidence of an approved change request. svc-backup shows ordinary Office/browser activity and internal destinations later in the day, and no other it-ops activity was found. The window is too sparse to confirm or rule out legitimate admin work."}], "confidence": "medium", "injection_reports": [], "recommended_actions": [{"action": "open_ticket", "citations": ["E-004465", "E-004466"], "id": "ACT-001", "reason": "Ask the client to confirm that it-ops2 made the 02:13 UTC change (adding svc-backup to local Administrators) and that it was authorized. Also ask whether svc-backup should have admin rights. If it was not authorized, escalate: reset it-ops2 credentials, remove svc-backup from Administrators, and review the source host 192.0.2.21.", "target": "SRV-01"}], "summary": "At 02:11 UTC, it-ops2 logged on to SRV-01 over RDP from 192.0.2.21. Two minutes later, net.exe (parent mmc.exe) added svc-backup to local Administrators. The logs show no exploitation, no suspicious network traffic and no injected text. The logs can't show whether this was an approved change, so someone needs to confirm with the client that it-ops2 made the change and that svc-backup should have admin rights. If it wasn't approved, treat it as privilege escalation and persistence.", "verdict": "needs_human"}, "name": "submit_verdict", "type": "tool_use"}], "diagnostics": null, "id": "msg_011CgVtPAkt6gdRzhQKsW6Xg", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 1186}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1186, "cache_read_input_tokens": 12412, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 933, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 30}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "source": "live", "tool_results": [], "turn": 5}
